              <description>Port A pull-up bit 15
When set, this bit activates the pull-up on PA[15] when APC bit is set in PWR_CR3 register.
If the corresponding PD15 bit is also set, the pull-up is not activated and the pull-down is activated instead with highest priority.</description>
