Writing 1 to this bit clears the FE flag in the USART_ISR register.</description>
              <bitOffset>1</bitOffset>
              <bitWidth>1</bitWidth>
              <access>write-only</access>
              <modifiedWriteValues>oneToClear</modifiedWriteValues>
              <enumeratedValues>
